# Line endings are LF in this repository, on every machine.
#
# Without this, git on Windows with core.autocrlf=true rewrites files to CRLF
# on checkout. Everything here was written with LF, so the result is a diff of
# fifty files where nothing actually changed — which buries the real change and
# turns every branch switch into a conflict. Marking the repo `text eol=lf`
# makes the working tree match what is stored, whoever checks it out.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, so git must never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
